ent-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">such as Kalamata olives sliced or chopped &ndash; 3 oz.</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="6"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">1</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cup</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">roasted red peppers</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">sliced and drained (or cut into small strips) (I use jarred)</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="7"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">1</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cup</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">marinated artichoke hearts</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">quartered and drained (7 oz after drained)</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="8"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">3</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">scallions</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">thinly sliced</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="9"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">2</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cups</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">arugula </span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">or baby spinach &ndash; washed and dried</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="10"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">4</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">oz.</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">feta cheese</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">crumbled </span></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">For the Mediterranean Dressing:</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-ingredients"><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="12"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">3</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoons</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">lemon juice </span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">or red wine vinegar</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="13"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">1</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">clove</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">garlic</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">minced</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="14"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac12;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">Dijon mustard</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="15"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac12;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">fresh oregano</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">finely chopped &ndash; or &#8539; teaspoon dried oregano</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="16"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac12;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">kosher salt</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">plus more to taste</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="17"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac14;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">ground black pepper</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="18"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">&frac14;</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">cup</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">extra virgin olive oil</span></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-unit-conversion-container wprm-unit-conversion-container-81566 wprm-unit-conversion-container-links wprm-block-text-normal" style=""><a href="#" role="button" class="wprm-unit-conversion wprmpuc-active" data-system="1" data-recipe="81566" style="" aria-label="Change unit system to US Customary">US Customary</a> &ndash; <a href="#" role="button" class="wprm-unit-conversion" data-system="2" data-recipe="81566" style="" aria-label="Change unit system to Metric">Metric</a></div></div>
<div id="recipe-81566-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-81566-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="81566"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-81566-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Cook the pasta until it&rsquo;s al dente, according to the package directions. Drain and rinse under cold water to stop the cooking process. Set it aside.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="A collage of images showing the cooked pasta and salad dressing for the recipe." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/vegetarian-Mediterranean-pasta-salad.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-81566-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">While the pasta is cooking, make the dressing by whisking together 3 tablespoons lemon juice (or vinegar), 1 clove of minced garlic, &frac12; teaspoon Dijon mustard, &frac12; teaspoon chopped oregano, &frac12; teaspoon of Kosher salt, and &frac14; teaspoon black pepper in a small bowl. Slowly drizzle in &frac14; cup of olive oil while whisking until fully emulsified.</span></div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-81566-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">To assemble the salad, in a large bowl, combine the cooked and cooled pasta, cucumber, tomatoes, olives, roasted red peppers, artichoke hearts, scallions, arugula, and feta cheese.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Images showing how to assemble the Mediterranean macaroni salad." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bistro-pasta-salad.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-81566-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Pour the dressing over the salad and toss gently to ensure all ingredients are evenly coated with the dressing. Taste for seasoning and add more if necessary.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-81566-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">If you have the time, cover and let it sit in the fridge for 30 minutes before serving.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="233" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad-350x233.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Pasta salad in a bowl with wooden utensils." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad-350x233.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad-768x512.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad-400x267.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad-150x100.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mediterranean-vegetable-pasta-salad.jpg"></div> </li></ul></div></div>
